(text (at 20.32 17.78 0)
	(effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
	(uuid "f8eab0e2-c6ed-4556-9850-20a4abe0b705")
	"PURPOSE: Prototype MI250X carrier power — separated domains per engineering architecture.\nDOMAINS: (1) 12V input  (2) OAM 12V + sequencing TODO  (3) 3.3V management\n(4) 3.3V logic/OAM aux  (5) Fan 12V  — 48V P48V explicitly NC Rev1.\nOCP: OCP Accelerator Module Design Specification v1.5 §8.2 Conn0/Conn1 power; Table 4 P12V1/2, P3V3, P48V.\nAMD: Rail currents, enables, Power Good, startup order — TODO (no rail table in repo).\nNO OAM connector power pin numbers assigned."
)
